    {
      "uid": "zhcn:508e95cd0328b5801fc52668",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌不受距离资质的影响，\n在“菊花赏”中获胜。\n不过她看起来一点都不开心……",
      "source_fingerprint": "12d343d83af4b123f4347bdf3b77c892356f730848fa2d7bcfaf3679597aa880",
