      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "参加“日本德比”时，\n她是因为不想输给那两人才燃起强烈的执着。\n而她这次却无法产生一样强大的“执着”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00576e8178f1f685f2f4b280cff3db91488787876ea65091179205dba51c0dd7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
